    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Noel Kelly Auctioneers are delighted to present this truly magnificent three bedroom family home which is presented in excellent condition and is located directly opposite the beautifully landscaped Father Collins Park. \r\n\r\nThis large three storey property enjoys all the comforts of modern day living with spacious living accommodation, large bedrooms, west facing balcony and flexible office space make this the perfect starter home for a growing family. Upon entry you are greeted by a light filled entrance hall, office/play room, guest wc and spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area with utility room and double doors opening onto a sizeable rear garden. On the first floor there is a lounge, family bathroom and double bedroom. The third level boasts a further two bedrooms including master bedroom with en suite. There is also access to a sunny west-facing balcony overlooking a park.\r\n\r\nClongriffin is a perfect estate for families, on the footsteps of Father Collins Park, close to schools, shops, cafes, Clongriffin Dart station, Dublin Airport, M1/M50 and whole host of other fantastic amenities close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall                          6.58 x 1.58\tTiled floor, radiator cover\r\n\r\nOffice/ Playroom\t3.77 x 2.66\tDecorative timber floor, blind\r\n \r\nGuest W.C\t        1.76 x 1.40\tTiled floor, w.c, w.h.b, heated rail\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen / \r\nDining Area\t       5.04 x 4.28       Tiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, tiled splashback, fridge freezer, double oven with induction hob, extractor, dishwasher, doors to garden\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility Room \t\t                       Washing machine\r\n\r\nStairs / Landing\t\t              Extra-large storage closet\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1\t     4.22 x 2.76\t      Decorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, blinds\r\nBathroom\t    3.23 x 1.40\t      Tiled floor, bath suite with shower, w.c, w.h.b with splashback, fitted cabinet, dome light\r\n\r\nLounge\t            4.26 x 4.17\t      Decorative timber floor, doors to Juliet balcony, TV point, curtains, electric fire\r\nStairs / Landing (2)\t\t              Access to attic, carpet floor, door to balcony\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2 (Master)\t4.23 x 3.17\t  Decorative timber floor, mirrored wardrobe, TV point\r\nEn suite\t                        4.17 x 1.0\t  Tiled floor& partial walls, fitted cabinet, heated rail, w.c, w.h.b, stand-alone shower, dome light, fan, shaving light\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \t         2.96 x 2.97\t     Decorative timber floor, fitted wardrobe, blind\r\n\t\t\r\nBalcony\t\t                                    Sunny west-facing aspect, overlooking park\r\n \r\nGarden\t\t                                    Outdoor power socket, paved and part lawn, fully fenced, flower bed with shrubs & plants, tap, garden shed with power"
